IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. USAGEDEMO.
AUTHOR.JU.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

     01 WS-DISPLAY PIC 9(5) DISPLAY.
     01 WS-COMP    PIC 9(5) COMP.
     01 WS-PACKED  PIC 9(5) COMP-3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

     MOVE 12345 TO WS-DISPLAY
     MOVE 12345 TO WS-COMP
     MOVE 12345 TO WS-PACKED
     
     DISPLAY 'DISPLAY VALUE: ' WS-DISPLAY
     DISPLAY 'COMP VALUE   : ' WS-COMP
     DISPLAY 'COMP-3 VALUE : ' WS-PACKED
     STOP RUN.

